OL,3,GNEWSAUK's 'longest-serving party
OL,4,Aleader' to stand down
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of Cornwall's best-known
OL,7,Fpoliticians who is understood to be the
OL,8,Flongest-serving leader of a political
OL,9,Fparty in the UK is standing down after
OL,10,F29 years in the role.
OL,12,FMebyon Kernow (MK) leader Dick Cole is
OL,13,Fdue to be replaced by Michael Bunney at
OL,14,FMK's national conference in Truro on 24
OL,15,FOctober, the party has announced.
OL,17,FCole has been involved in campaigns for
OL,18,Fgreater recognition for Cornwall and
OL,19,Fthe Cornish language, and to secure
OL,20,Fdevolution for the Cornish nation,
OL,21,Faccording to the Local Democracy
OL,22,FReporting Service.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
